  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-preferred-pronouns</b></p><a name=\"ahip-preferred-pronouns\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-preferred-pronouns\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29518-0/\">LA29518-0</a></td><td>He, him, his</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29519-8/\">LA29519-8</a></td><td>She, her, hers</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29520-6/\">LA29520-6</a></td><td>They, them, theirs (non-binary)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29523-0/\">LA29523-0</a></td><td>Ze, hir, hirs (non-binary)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29521-4/\">LA29521-4</a></td><td>Ze, zir, zirs (non-binary)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>UMN</td><td>Use my name</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
